 "notes": [
  "Post hoc analysis; its plan was committed to the repository before the analysis was run ({{N:note_data_code}}). Critical records (Alarm or Caution) 2021-2025, n=4283. Lexicons, word-boundary matching and MeSH matching are those of the prespecified lexicon analysis ({{N:note_mesh_keywords}}). Row (a) reproduces the lexicon series in {{T:lexicon_and_terms}} exactly, and (a) is the union of (b) and (c) for every record. Rows (d) and (e) split the title + abstract text at the 400th abstract character, the input limit of the concern-theme classifier; a term that straddles character 400 is counted in neither.",
  "Cells: % (95% CI); n/N, with N = critical records of that year (2021 270; 2022 333; 2023 624; 2024 1228; 2025 1828). CIs: 95% percentile bootstrap, 1000 joint resamples of records, seed 42. OR per year: record-level logistic regression on publication year with journal cluster-robust SEs (1215 journals).",
  "Cells with no or all events show the exact Clopper-Pearson interval ('exact'). Single-term rows use the title + abstract text of row (b); 'human oversight' is an added phrase, not a lexicon term. Critical stance was Alarm or Caution."
